<HEAD>PART 2580&#x2014;TEMPORARY BONDING RULES
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>Sec. 505, Pub. L. 93-406, 88 Stat. 894 (29 U.S.C. 1135); sec. 412(e), Pub. L. 93-406, 88 Stat. 889 (29 U.S.C. 1112).
</PSPACE></AUTH>
<SOURCE>
